        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><br/>Whether you're in the field, on base, or supporting critical operations, <strong>GovEyewear</strong> delivers mission-ready protection backed by experience and service. We specialize in <strong>TAA-compliant</strong>, <strong>MILSPEC ballistic-rated</strong>, and <strong>ANSI Z87.1-certified</strong> eyewear designed to meet the operational demands of military, law enforcement, and federal end users.<br/>Our curated selection includes laser-protective lenses, anti-fog coatings, photochromic transitions, and low-profile tactical frames engineered for helmets, comms gear, and harsh environments. We partner with top-tier manufacturers like <strong>Gatorz</strong>, <strong>ESS</strong>, and <strong>Revision</strong> to ensure your eyewear meets or exceeds government standards.<br/>Tested and Battle Ready.</p>"
